    "created_at": "2024-08-13T09:31:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-08-13T09:31:08Z",
    "body": "I agree that it's a bit vague and can be better, but this is incorrect. A node's attribute list is a list, not a NamedNodeMap.",
