    "updated_at": "2024-08-13T09:37:07Z",
    "body": "https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attribute\r\n\r\n> [Elements](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element) also have an attribute list, which is a [list](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list) exposed through a [NamedNodeMap](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#namednodemap). Unless explicitly given when an [element](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element) is created, its [attribute list](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attribute) [is empty](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-is-empty).\r\n\r\nI thought the exposed through a NamedNodeMap bit was enough? Or does the getter steps need to explicitly specify how to do that?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/dom/issues/comments/2285812694/reactions",
